1
00:00:00,150 --> 00:00:02,170
(Sheldon-bot:)You're in my spot.

2
00:00:14,540 --> 00:00:17,790
(Sheldon-bot:)This may seem a little odd
at first,

3
00:00:17,790 --> 00:00:20,440
(Sheldon-bot:)but over time,
you'll grow accustomed

4
00:00:20,450 --> 00:00:23,700
(Sheldon-bot:)to dealing with me
in this configuration.

5
00:00:23,700 --> 00:00:26,630
(Penny:)Yeah, to be honest, I
don't see much difference.

6
00:00:26,630 --> 00:00:27,830
(Leonard:)Thank you.

7
00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:30,050
(Sheldon-bot:)That's what I was going for.

8
00:00:31,340 --> 00:00:34,760
(Sheldon-bot:)Now, Leonard, tomorrow,
when we go to work,

9
00:00:34,760 --> 00:00:36,710
(Sheldon-bot:)you'll need to allow
some extra time

10
00:00:36,710 --> 00:00:38,530
(Sheldon-bot:)to get me down the stairs.

11
00:00:38,530 --> 00:00:43,150
(Sheldon-bot:)For your convenience,
I disassemble into four pieces.

12
00:00:43,150 --> 00:00:44,230
(Leonard:)This is ridiculous.

13
00:00:44,240 --> 00:00:45,400
(Leonard:)I'm coming to talk to you.

14
00:00:45,400 --> 00:00:47,700
(Sheldon-bot:)You don't know where I am.

15
00:00:49,110 --> 00:00:51,740
(Sheldon-bot:)My physical body
is safely ensconced

16
00:00:51,740 --> 00:00:54,440
(Sheldon-bot:)in a secure,
undisclosed location.

17
00:00:54,450 --> 00:00:56,050
(Leonard:)You're in your bedroom.

18
00:00:56,050 --> 00:00:57,630
(Sheldon-bot:)No, I'm not.

19
00:00:57,630 --> 00:01:02,020
(Leonard:)I can hear your voice
coming from your bedroom.

